---
/*
 * Button lab — hover + type + shape.
 *
 * Dev-only. Not part of production build. Delete or gate before merging.
 * Shows current brutalist button vs buttery variants that combine shape,
 * shadow, gradient tinge and Recursive type.
 */
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>button lab | wolfw.xyz</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Recursive:slnt,wght,CASL,MONO@-15..0,300..1000,0..1,0..1&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/Necto-Mono.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <style>
      @import "../styles/tokens.css";
    </style>
    <style>
      :root { --lab-grid: #ececec; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { background: #f6f0ff; }
      body { margin: 0; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; color: #111; line-height: 1.5; }
      a { color: inherit; }
      .lab-header {
        max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 1rem;
      }
      .lab-header h1 {
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 700, "slnt" 0;
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
        line-height: 1.1; margin: 0 0 0.35rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      .lab-header p.lead { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #444; max-width: 68ch; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
      .lab-header .meta { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #777; }
      .lab-header .meta code { font-size: 0.92em; background: #eee; padding: 0.1em 0.3em; border-radius: 3px; }
      .lab-section {
        max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.6rem 1.25rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--lab-grid); background: #fff;
      }
      .lab-section h2 {
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0, "CASL" 0, "wght" 700, "slnt" 0;
        font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #6b4db3; margin: 0 0 1rem;
      }
      .lab-note { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #666; max-width: 68ch; margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem; line-height: 1.6; }
      .lab-note strong { color: #222; }
      /* Baseline brutalist button — as shipped today */
      .btn {
        display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 520px;
        padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid #000; background: #fff; color: inherit;
        text-align: center; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;
        font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1rem;
        box-shadow: 4px 4px #000;
        transition: box-shadow 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1), transform 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
      }
      .btn:hover { box-shadow: 2px 2px #000; }
      .btn:active { box-shadow: none; transform: translate(4px, 4px); }
      /* Lab button base — resets for variants */
      .btn-lab {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem; border: 1px solid #000; background: #fff;
        font-family: "Recursive", sans-serif;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 500, "slnt" 0;
        font-size: 0.92rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; color: #111;
        box-shadow: 4px 4px #000;
        transition:
          box-shadow 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1),
          transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1),
          border-radius 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1),
          background 0.55s ease,
          border-color 0.45s ease,
          font-variation-settings 0.62s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
      }
      /* Variant A — soft: radius + blurred shadow, buttery spring */
      .btn-soft:hover {
        border-radius: 14px;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.14), 4px 4px #000;
        transform: translateY(-1px);
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0.51, "CASL" 0.28, "wght" 620, "slnt" -1;
        background: #fffdf8;
      }
      .btn-soft:active {
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
      /* Variant B — gradient tinge: subtle warm wash + gradient border */
      .btn-tinge {
        position: relative; background: #fff; border-color: #000;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .btn-tinge::before {
        content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: inherit;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #bc89ff 0%, #ffe8a3 55%, #ff9a9e 100%);
        opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.55s ease;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .btn-tinge:hover::before { opacity: 0.18; }
      .btn-tinge:hover {
        border-color: #3a1a7a;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(188,137,255,0.28), 3px 3px #000;
        transform: translateY(-1px);
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0.51, "CASL" 0.22, "wght" 640, "slnt" -1;
      }
      /* Variant C — pill morph: brutalist → pill, shadow evaporates */
      .btn-pill:hover {
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding-inline: 1.8rem;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
        transform: translateY(-1px);
        background: #111; color: #fff; border-color: #111;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0.6, "CASL" 0.45, "wght" 680, "slnt" -1;
      }
      .btn-pill:active { transform: translateY(0) scale(0.99); }
      /* Variant D — type wave on hover: per-letter stagger, shape stays */
      .btn-wave span.char {
        display: inline-block;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 520, "slnt" 0;
        transition: font-variation-settings 0.52s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
      }
      .btn-wave:hover span.char {
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0.51, "CASL" 0.35, "wght" 680, "slnt" -2;
      }
      .btn-wave:hover { box-shadow: 2px 2px #000; transform: translateY(-1px); }
      /* Variant E — combined: soft + tinge + type */
      .btn-combo {
        border-radius: 6px;
        background: #fff;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 500, "slnt" 0;
      }
      .btn-combo span.char {
        display: inline-block;
        transition: font-variation-settings 0.58s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 500, "slnt" 0;
      }
      .btn-combo:hover {
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, #f6f0ff 55%, #fff7e6 100%);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(188,137,255,0.22), 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        transform: translateY(-1.5px);
        border-color: #7a4bd6;
      }
      .btn-combo:hover span.char {
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0.51, "CASL" 0.32, "wght" 700, "slnt" -2;
      }
      /* Variant F — buttery spring: overshoot + settle */
      .btn-butter:hover {
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.14);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0.55, "CASL" 0.3, "wght" 650, "slnt" -1.5;
        background: #fffffe;
      }
      /* ── Subtle butter — refined per feedback ──────────────────────────
         Slippy → smooth: longer duration, sine ease (no spring), barely-there
         shadow change, type whispers. MONO 1 → 0.82 so the button doesn't grow.
         The brutalist hard shadow stays; it just softens, it doesn't bloom. */
      .btn-subtle {
        /* sharp stays — no rounding, brutalist */
        border-radius: 0;
        background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 4px 4px #000;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 520, "slnt" 0;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        transition:
          box-shadow 0.62s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94),
          background 0.62s ease,
          transform 0.62s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94),
          letter-spacing 0.68s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94),
          font-variation-settings 0.68s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94);
      }
      .btn-subtle:hover {
        border-radius: 0;
        /* shadow barely moves — hard offset stays, just a whisper of blur */
        box-shadow: 4px 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.10), 3px 3px #000;
        transform: translateY(-0.5px);
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0.82, "CASL" 0.14, "wght" 560, "slnt" -0.6;
        background: #fffefb;
      }
      .btn-subtle-tinge {
        position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      }
      .btn-subtle-tinge::before {
        content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: inherit;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #bc89ff 0%, #ffe8a3 60%, #ffd6e7 100%);
        opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.62s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94);
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .btn-subtle-tinge:hover::before { opacity: 0.10; }
      .btn-subtle-tinge:hover {
        border-radius: 0;
        box-shadow: 4px 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.08), 3px 3px #000;
        border-color: #2a1a4a;
      }
      /* Per-letter subtle — same whisper, staggered */
      .btn-subtle-wave span.char {
        display: inline-block;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 520, "slnt" 0;
        transition: font-variation-settings 0.68s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94);
      }
      .btn-subtle-wave:hover span.char {
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0.82, "CASL" 0.14, "wght" 560, "slnt" -0.6;
      }
      /* Width-stable: lock outer width so MONO doesn't make the button grow.
         JS measures and sets inline width on [data-lock-width] at load. */
      .btn-locked { width: var(--locked-w); }
      /* Reduced motion — no shape or type transform */
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .btn-lab, .btn-lab span.char { transition: none !important; }
        .btn-lab:hover { transform: none !important; border-radius: 0 !important; }
      }
      .variant {
        border: 1px solid var(--lab-grid); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.1rem;
        background: #fbfaf8; margin-top: 0.9rem;
      }
      .variant .label {
        font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #888; margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
      }
      .variant .row { display: flex; gap: 0.7rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
      .variant .desc { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #555; margin-top: 0.6rem; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 68ch; }
      .variant .desc code { font-size: 0.85em; background: #eee; padding: 0.1em 0.3em; border-radius: 3px; }
      /* ── Buttery glass — frosted, sharp stays, whisper type ───────────── */
      .glass-stage {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #bc89ff 0%, #d4b8ff 30%, #ffe8a3 78%, #ffd6e7 100%);
        border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.4rem 1rem; margin-top: 0.6rem;
        position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      }
      .glass-stage::before {
        content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0.35;
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 20% 30%, rgba(255,255,255,0.55) 0%, transparent 60%),
          radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 50% at 85% 70%, rgba(255,255,255,0.35) 0%, transparent 55%);
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .btn-glass {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: 0;
        border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.68);
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(1.4);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(1.4);
        box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.92), 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 520, "slnt" 0;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        transition:
          background 0.62s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94),
          backdrop-filter 0.62s ease,
          border-color 0.5s ease,
          box-shadow 0.62s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94),
          transform 0.62s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94),
          letter-spacing 0.68s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94),
          font-variation-settings 0.68s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94);
      }
      .btn-glass:hover {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.86);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(1.5);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(1.5);
        border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.14);
        box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.92), 0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
        transform: translateY(-0.5px);
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0.82, "CASL" 0.14, "wght" 560, "slnt" -0.6;
      }
      .btn-glass span.char {
        display: inline-block;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 520, "slnt" 0;
        transition: font-variation-settings 0.68s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94);
      }
      .btn-glass:hover span.char {
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 0.82, "CASL" 0.14, "wght" 560, "slnt" -0.6;
      }
      .btn-glass-tinge::after {
        content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(188,137,255,0.0) 0%, rgba(255,232,163,0.0) 60%, rgba(255,214,231,0.0) 100%);
        opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.62s ease; pointer-events: none;
      }
      .btn-glass-tinge:hover::after { opacity: 1; }
      .btn-glass-tinge:hover {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
        border-color: rgba(42,26,74,0.18);
      }
      /* width-stable glass */
      .btn-glass.btn-locked { width: var(--locked-w); justify-content: center; }
      /* ── Stable — no shift, no grow ─────────────────────────────────── */
      .btn-stable {
        border-radius: 0;
        background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 4px 4px #000;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 520, "slnt" 0;
        /* no letter-spacing, no transform — button and phrase never move */
        transition:
          background 0.58s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94),
          border-color 0.5s ease,
          box-shadow 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94),
          font-variation-settings 0.66s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94);
      }
      .btn-stable:hover {
        background: #fffefb;
        border-color: #000;
        /* shadow moves — brutalist compress, button itself stays */
        box-shadow: 2px 2px #000;
        /* MONO stays 1 — only CASL/wght/slnt move, so advance widths don't change.
           slnt bumped to -1.8 for ST2 so the slant is just visible on hover. */
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0.22, "wght" 560, "slnt" -1.8;
      }
      .btn-stable.btn-stable-tinge { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
      .btn-stable.btn-stable-tinge::before {
        content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #bc89ff 0%, #ffe8a3 60%, #ffd6e7 100%);
        opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.58s ease; pointer-events: none;
      }
      .btn-stable.btn-stable-tinge:hover::before { opacity: 0.10; }
      .btn-stable span.char {
        display: inline-block;
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0, "wght" 520, "slnt" 0;
        transition: font-variation-settings 0.66s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94);
      }
      .btn-stable:hover span.char {
        font-variation-settings: "MONO" 1, "CASL" 0.22, "wght" 560, "slnt" -1.8;
      }
      .lab-footer {
        max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.2rem 1.25rem 2.5rem;
        font-size: 0.82rem; color: #777; border-top: 1px solid var(--lab-grid); background: #fff;
      }
      .lab-footer a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="lab-header">
      <h1>Button lab — buttery + type</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Current brutalist button vs variants that play <em>shape, shadow, gradient tinge and Recursive type</em> together on hover.
        Hover each — whole heading vs per-letter, soft vs pill, tinge vs combo. All respect <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>.
      </p>
      <p class="meta">
        Dev-only. Not in production. <a href="/type-lab/">← type lab</a> · <a href="/">← back to site</a>
        &nbsp; Base: <code>MONO 1 → 0.51</code> so glyphs never switch past the threshold you caught.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="lab-section">
      <h2>Baseline — as shipped today</h2>
      <p class="lab-note">Hard 1px border, white, <code>4px 4px #000</code> shadow compressing to <code>2px 2px</code> on hover. No radius, no gradient, Necto Mono. The shadow <em>is</em> the animation.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="#">work</a>
      <p class="lab-note" style="margin-top:0.6rem">↑ brutalist, correct, a bit severe. The variants below keep the shadow language but soften it.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-section">
      <h2>Variants — hover each</h2>
      <p class="lab-note">All variants animate <code>border-radius</code> + <code>box-shadow</code> + <code>transform</code> + <code>font-variation-settings</code> together — the buttery feel is the <em>combined</em> easing, not any one property.</p>

      <div class="variant">
        <div class="label">A — Soft · radius + blurred shadow · buttery spring</div>
        <div class="row"><button class="btn-lab btn-soft">work</button><button class="btn-lab btn-soft">about</button><a class="btn-lab btn-soft" href="#">github →</a></div>
        <div class="desc"><code>border-radius 0 → 14px</code> · shadow blooms to <code>0 8px 24px</code> + hard offset · <code>translateY(-1px)</code> with <code>cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1)</code> spring · type <code>MONO 1 → 0.51</code> whole-word.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="variant">
        <div class="label">B — Gradient tinge · warm wash on hover</div>
        <div class="row"><button class="btn-lab btn-tinge">work</button><button class="btn-lab btn-tinge">käkriäinen</button><a class="btn-lab btn-tinge" href="#">visualizing government →</a></div>
        <div class="desc">Pseudo-element gradient <code>#bc89ff → #ffe8a3 → #ff9a9e</code> at <code>opacity 0 → 0.18</code> behind the label · border tints to <code>#3a1a7a</code> · radius 12px. The purple ties it to the page.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="variant">
        <div class="label">C — Pill morph · brutalist → pill, shadow evaporates</div>
        <div class="row"><button class="btn-lab btn-pill">work</button><button class="btn-lab btn-pill">send me some facts</button><a class="btn-lab btn-pill" href="#">get in touch →</a></div>
        <div class="desc"><code>border-radius 999px</code> · background inverts to <code>#111</code> · shadow becomes soft <code>0 6px 20px</code> — the block becomes a pill, the shadow becomes bloom. Most dramatic, most “different site”.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="variant">
        <div class="label">D — Type wave · per-letter stagger, shape stays brutalist</div>
        <div class="row"><button class="btn-lab btn-wave" data-wave>work</button><button class="btn-lab btn-wave" data-wave>about</button><button class="btn-lab btn-wave" data-wave>github</button></div>
        <div class="desc">Shape stays — only the <em>letters</em> ripple <code>MONO 1 → 0.51</code> at <code>42ms</code> stagger per glyph. Hover the word and it shivers mono→proportional left→right.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="variant">
        <div class="label">E — Combo · soft + tinge + type (the maximal buttery)</div>
        <div class="row"><button class="btn-lab btn-combo" data-wave>work</button><button class="btn-lab btn-combo" data-wave>visualizing government</button><a class="btn-lab btn-combo" data-wave href="#">käkriäinen →</a></div>
        <div class="desc">Radius 6→14px · gradient wash · shadow blooms to <code>0 12px 32px</code> · <em>per-letter</em> type wave underneath. The one where everything moves together.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="variant">
        <div class="label">F — Buttery spring · overshoot + settle</div>
        <div class="row"><button class="btn-lab btn-butter">work</button><button class="btn-lab btn-butter">linkedin</button><a class="btn-lab btn-butter" href="#">art →</a></div>
        <div class="desc">Same soft radius + shadow but with <code>cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1)</code> spring on <code>transform</code> — the button lifts, overshoots, settles. Feels physical rather than interpolated.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-section" style="background:#f6f0ff">
      <h2 style="color:#111">Subtle butter — refined</h2>
      <p class="lab-note" style="color:#333">
        Your notes, addressed: <strong>jumpy → smooth</strong> (sine ease <code>0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94</code> instead of spring, 0.62–0.68s, no overshoot),
        <strong>rounding → none</strong> (sharp stays, brutalist), <strong>shadow → whisper</strong> (hard offset stays <code>4px 4px #000</code>, just a 10px blur halo),
        <strong>type → whisper + tracking</strong> (<code>MONO 1 → 0.82</code> so the button doesn't grow, <code>-0.01em → 0.04em</code> tracking),
        <strong>gradient → 10% wash</strong> not 18%. The mono threshold stays at <code>0.51</code> — these stop at <code>0.82</code>, well above it.
      </p>

      <div class="variant" style="background:#fff">
        <div class="label">S1 — Subtle soft · sharp stays · shadow whisper + tracking</div>
        <div class="row"><button class="btn-lab btn-subtle">work</button><button class="btn-lab btn-subtle">about</button><a class="btn-lab btn-subtle" href="#">github →</a></div>
        <div class="desc">Sharp stays; hover adds 10px blur halo + <code>translateY(-0.5px)</code> + tracking <code>-0.01em → 0.04em</code> + type whisper <code>MONO 1 → 0.82</code>. Sine ease, 0.68s.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="variant" style="background:#fff">
        <div class="label">S2 — Subtle tinge · 10% wash · sharp stays</div>
