    <section class="lab-section" style="background:#fff;border-top:2px solid #111">
      <h2 style="color:#111">Stable — no shift, no grow</h2>
      <p class="lab-note" style="color:#333">
        Your last notes: <strong>no position shift</strong> (so no <code>translateY</code>, no shadow offset change) and
        <strong>no phrase size change</strong> (so no <code>MONO</code>, no <code>letter-spacing</code> — both change advance widths).
        These hover <em>only</em> on axes that keep the phrase size the same: <code>CASL</code> + <code>wght</code> (+ tiny <code>slnt</code>).
        Sharp stays, hard <code>4px 4px #000</code> stays exactly, outer width stays via <code>--locked-w</code>.
      </p>
      <style>
        /* scoped to this section via extra class to avoid leaking */
      </style>
      <div class="variant">
        <div class="label">ST1 — Stable whisper · whole-word · no move</div>
        <div class="row"><button class="btn-lab btn-stable">work</button><button class="btn-lab btn-stable">about</button><a class="btn-lab btn-stable" href="#">github →</a></div>
        <div class="desc"><code>CASL 0 → 0.22</code> · <code>wght 520 → 560</code> · <code>slnt 0 → -0.6</code> · no radius, no shadow move, no tracking, <code>MONO</code> stays 1. The button doesn't move and doesn't grow.</div>
