        <div class="desc">Per-letter <code>62ms</code> stagger, but <em>width-stable axes only</em> — each glyph whispers the same <code>CASL/wght</code>, <code>MONO</code> stays 1 so the phrase length never changes.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="variant">
        <div class="label">ST4 — Glass stable · frosted + stable whisper</div>
        <div class="glass-stage" style="padding:1.2rem">
          <div style="display:flex;gap:0.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative">
            <button class="btn-lab btn-glass btn-stable">work</button>
            <button class="btn-lab btn-glass btn-stable">about</button>
            <button class="btn-lab btn-glass" data-wave-stable>github</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="desc">Glass stays frosted (<code>0.68 → 0.86</code>), no offset change, no lift — just the type whisper inside the frost.</div>
      </div>
      <p class="lab-note">This is the honest “buttery glass” without the slip: the glass doesn't move, the type doesn't make the box grow, the phrase stays the same length. If the earlier variants felt jumpy, this is the control.</p>
